      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>FeSL enforcement - see org.fcrepo.server.security.xacml.pep.rest.filters.ListDatastreamsFilter.handleRequest(...)</p>\n\n<p>This will need to detect the query parameter that distinguishes between the existing API-A call and the new API-M call and construct the XACML request context appropriately (ie API-M instead of API-A, and instead of Constants.ACTION.LIST_DATASTREAMS the equivalent API-M method).</p>",
     "created": "02/Aug/11 6:21 PM",
     "id": "12026",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/10956/comment/12026",
