     "body": "<p>added fix to github:<br/>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/fasseg/fcrepo/tree/fcrepo-951\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fasseg/fcrepo/tree/fcrepo-951</a><br/>\nimplemented the missing functionality in listDatastreams by checking a new queryparameter \"listProfiles\"</p>",
