  "description": "<p>The REST API does not have the equivalent of API-M getDatastreams.  Instead it is necessary to list datastreams using the /objects/pid/datastreams endpoint and then iterate each of the datastreams.</p>\n\n<p>Add getDatastreams to the REST API.</p>\n\n<p>For discussion:</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>should this be a different endpoint to the /objects/pid/datastereams endpoint?</li>\n\t<li>or should we add a URL parameter on the same endpoint?</li>\n\t<li>need to consider any AuthZ implications (as listDatastreams is API-A and getDatastreams is API-M)</li>\n</ul>\n",
